 In Memoriam 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Dave Retik (left) and Chris Mello (right) Please take a moment to remember the thousands of people murdered 25 years ago this morning.

 Among them were private equity investors Dave Retik and Chris Mello , both of whom worked at Alta Communications and were on American Airlines Flight 11. The foundation established in their names has since awarded $4.2 million in grants to more than 61 nonprofit organizations, plus more than 60 scholarships. 
 
